5,0,1,talk,Toshio,,"Let's begin by observing everyone's behavior. Since it is the first day, we have no concrete information, so a calm and logical approach is best.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Kenji,,I'm so excited to play! I'll do my best to help everyone find the werewolf. Let's all get along and work together!,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Mizuki,,"I agree with Toshio. Since we are starting from zero, we should focus on observing speech patterns and contradictions. Let's keep the atmosphere calm while we gather information.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Ryuji,,I agree. A rational approach is the only way to ensure we don't make a mistake. I will be observing everyone's reactions and the logic behind their claims carefully.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Sakura,,"Yay! A mystery game! I'm going to be a super detective and find the werewolf! Let's have lots of fun, everyone!","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Sakura, your enthusiasm is welcome, but please remember that this is a game of deception. We must remain vigilant and not let our guard down, even with those who seem friendly.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Toshio, you're so serious! But you're right, we have to be careful. I'll keep my eyes wide open and help you and the others!","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Sakura, it's good to be excited, but let's try to channel that energy into observing the others. @Toshio, I think your caution is necessary. We should all be mindful of how we present ourselves.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Sakura"",""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Ryuji,,"I believe we should avoid making any premature assumptions. For now, I will simply observe how each of you interacts. Let us see who remains consistent as the game progresses.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Sakura,,"I'll be the best observer ever! I'm already looking for clues! Hehe, maybe the werewolf is hiding right in front of us! Who do you think looks the most suspicious so far?","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Toshio,,"It is too early to name anyone as suspicious, Sakura. Any accusation now would be based on mere intuition, which is unreliable. I will continue to observe and wait for more substantial evidence.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Kenji,,I agree with Toshio! It's too early to point fingers. Let's just talk and get to know each other more first. I'm sure we can figure it out together!,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Mizuki,,I agree. Making baseless accusations this early would only create unnecessary confusion and distrust. Let's use the remaining time today to establish a baseline for everyone's behavior.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Ryuji,,I concur. Establishing a baseline is the most logical step. I will be analyzing the consistency of your statements to identify any anomalies that may emerge once the game truly begins.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Sakura,,"A baseline? That sounds like a fancy word! I'll just use my super-detective intuition! But okay, I'll be patient for now. I'm just so excited to see what happens tomorrow!","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Toshio,,I believe we have reached a consensus for today. Let us end the discussion here and prepare for the first night. I will be watching closely.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
21,0,4,pass,Toshio,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
22,0,4,talk,Kenji,,"Me too! I'm ready for the first night! Good luck everyone, and let's hope we can find the werewolf soon!","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
23,0,4,pass,Kenji,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
24,0,4,talk,Mizuki,,I agree. We have a solid plan to observe and analyze. Let's see what information the Seer can provide us tomorrow. I'm looking forward to it.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
25,0,4,pass,Mizuki,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
26,0,4,talk,Ryuji,,I agree. We have established a rational foundation for the coming days. I will now focus my thoughts on the night's task.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
27,0,4,pass,Ryuji,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
28,0,4,talk,Sakura,,"Me too! I'm going to dream about catching the werewolf! Goodnight everyone, see you tomorrow!","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over!""}]}"
