69,2,1,talk,Toshio,,"Kenji has been executed, and Ryuji, our Seer, was attacked. This is a critical blow to the village. The werewolf clearly viewed Ryuji as the biggest threat. We must now rely on the information he provided.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,2,1,talk,Mizuki,,"It is a devastating loss. The werewolf's strategy was clear: eliminate the Seer to blind the village. Since Ryuji confirmed Toshio is human, we must trust Toshio's judgment completely to find the remaining culprit.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Ryuji"",""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,2,1,talk,Sakura,,"Oh no! Ryuji is gone! That's so sad! The werewolf is super mean for attacking the Seer! Now we're like detectives without a magnifying glass! @Toshio, you're the only one we know is a good guy, so you have to lead us!","{""words"":42,""mentions"":[""Ryuji"",""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"I accept this responsibility. Since Ryuji is gone, we must analyze the remaining players: Mizuki and Sakura. The werewolf is one of them, and the Possessed is the other. We must identify the werewolf to win.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Ryuji"",""Mizuki"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,2,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Toshio, I appreciate you taking the lead. Since we are down to three, the logic is simple: if we execute the wrong person, the werewolf wins. @Sakura, you've been very cheerful, but this is the moment to be serious. What do you think?","{""words"":43,""mentions"":[""Toshio"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,2,2,talk,Sakura,,"I'm being serious! I'm really serious! I'm just a little girl, so I don't know all the fancy logic, but I don't like that the werewolf is still here! @Mizuki, you're always so calm... it's almost scary! Are you the mean werewolf?","{""words"":42,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,2,3,talk,Toshio,,"@Sakura, your intuition is not evidence. @Mizuki, your composure is consistent, but in this situation, the werewolf and the Possessed both have a reason to appear rational. We must determine who is more likely to be the werewolf.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Sakura"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,2,3,talk,Mizuki,,"@Toshio, you are correct. Both the werewolf and the Possessed would benefit from appearing helpful. However, consider Sakura's behavior; her constant deflection through playfulness could be a mask. If I were the werewolf, would I be this transparently supportive of your leadership?","{""words"":42,""mentions"":[""Toshio"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,2,3,talk,Sakura,,"That's not fair! I'm not masking anything, I'm just me! @Mizuki, you're trying to make me look like a bad guy just because I'm not a robot like you! I'm a villager, I promise! @Toshio, please believe me!","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Mizuki"",""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,2,4,talk,Toshio,,"@Sakura, @Mizuki, please listen. We are at a stalemate. If Sakura is the werewolf, she is using her persona to avoid scrutiny. If Mizuki is the werewolf, she is using logic to manipulate me. However, the werewolf's goal is to survive. Between the two of you, Mizuki's approach is more calculated.","{""words"":51,""mentions"":[""Sakura"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,2,4,talk,Mizuki,,"@Toshio, being calculated is not the same as being guilty; it is simply how I process information. If you execute me based on my personality, you are playing into the werewolf's hands. Is Sakura's unpredictability not a more effective shield?","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Toshio"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
80,2,4,talk,Sakura,,"@Toshio, don't listen to her! She's trying to trick you with all those big words! I'm just a little girl, I can't be a scary werewolf! Please, please vote for Mizuki! I want to win!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Toshio"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
